per un entramat de carrers que fusionen l&#8217;eleg\u00e0ncia georgiana amb l&#8217;\u00e0nima mediterr\u00e0nia.<\/span><\/p><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Qu\u00e8 descobrir\u00e0s en aquest tour?<\/span><\/strong><\/p><ul><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">La <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Pla\u00e7a de s\u2019Esplanada<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">, el cor social de la ciutat.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">L&#8217;arquitectura \u00fanica dels seus <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">edificis d&#8217;estil georgi\u00e0<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">, un llegat del segle XVIII.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">El <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Teatre Principal de Ma\u00f3<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">, un dels teatres d&#8217;\u00f2pera m\u00e9s antics d&#8217;Espanya.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">L&#8217;hist\u00f2ric <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Mercat del Claustre del Carme<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">, ple de vida i productes locals.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">L&#8217;Ajuntament (Sa Sala) i la <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Esgl\u00e9sia de Santa Maria<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">, amb la seva imponent fa\u00e7ana.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Miradors estrat\u00e8gics amb vistes espectaculars al port.<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Idiomes:<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\"> Castell\u00e0, angl\u00e8s i franc\u00e8s. <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Durada:<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\"> 2 hores.<\/span><\/p><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Inclou:<\/span><\/strong><\/p><ul><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Recorregut a peu amb una guia oficial acreditada.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Explicacions hist\u00f2riques i culturals detallades.<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">No inclou:<\/span><\/strong><\/p><ul><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Entrades a monuments que requereixin tiquet (opcional).<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Transport fins al punt de trobada.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Propines.<\/span><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Pol\u00edtica de Cancel\u00b7laci\u00f3<\/span><\/strong><\/p><p><span class=\"gmail-selected\">En reservar, acceptes les seg\u00fcents condicions:<\/span><\/p><ul><li><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Cancel\u00b7laci\u00f3 gratu\u00efta:<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\"> Podr\u00e0s cancel\u00b7lar sense cap cost fins a <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">24 hores<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">  abans de l&#8217;hora d&#8217;inici del tour. Se&#8217;t reemborsar\u00e0 el 100% de l&#8217;import. <\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Cancel\u00b7lacions tardanes o no presentaci\u00f3:<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\"> Si cancel\u00b7les amb menys de 24 hores d&#8217;antelaci\u00f3 o no et presentes al punt de trobada a l&#8217;hora acordada, no es realitzar\u00e0 cap reemborsament.<\/span><\/p><\/li><li><p><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">Cancel\u00b7laci\u00f3 per part del guia:<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">  El tour podr\u00e0 ser cancel\u00b7lat per causes de for\u00e7a major (ex. alerta meteorol\u00f2gica). Addicionalment, en ser un tour en grup,   <\/span><strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">\u00e9s necessari un nombre m\u00ednim de participants per a la seva realitzaci\u00f3<\/span><\/strong><span class=\"gmail-selected\">. Si no s&#8217;assoleix aquest m\u00ednim, el tour ser\u00e0 cancel\u00b7lat. En qualsevol d&#82